OL,3,GNEWSATeen shooting organiser found
OL,4,Aguilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who organised the fatal shooting
OL,7,Fof a teenager by a gunman disguised as
OL,8,Fa Just Eat delivery rider has been
OL,9,Ffound guilty of murder.
OL,11,FLathaniel Burrell, 16, was shot dead in
OL,12,FParadise Road, Stockwell, south London,
OL,13,Fon the afternoon of 4 March 2025.
OL,15,FFollowing a trial at the Old Bailey,
OL,16,FJeffrey Frimpong, 32, who organised the
OL,17,Fkilling, was found guilty of murder,
OL,18,Fand Kimani Hamilton, 19, was found
OL,19,Fguilty of perverting the course of
OL,20,Fjustice.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
