OL,3,GNEWSATeen shooting organiser found
OL,4,Aguilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third defendant, Philippe Kouakou,
OL,7,F18, who was accused of "calling on" the
OL,8,Fshooting, was cleared of murder.
